---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Community" description="RepoTunnel source, issues, security reporting and contribution links.">
  <div class="container listing-head"><span class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-dot"></span>Open source</span><h1>Build, report, contribute</h1><p>RepoTunnel is public on GitHub under the MIT License. Use the repository for source code, issues, pull requests, release assets and security policy.</p></div>
  <div class="container listing-grid">
    <article class="card listing-card"><span class="eyebrow">Source</span><h2>GitHub repository</h2><p>Inspect the current code, documentation and project history.</p><a class="card-link" href="https://github.com/Yashwanth034/RepoTunnel">Open repository</a></article>
    <article class="card listing-card"><span class="eyebrow">Feedback</span><h2>Issues</h2><p>Report bugs and request product improvements without including secrets or private project content.</p><a class="card-link" href="https://github.com/Yashwanth034/RepoTunnel/issues">Open issues</a></article>
    <article class="card listing-card"><span class="eyebrow">Security</span><h2>Security policy</h2><p>Use the repository security guidance for vulnerabilities. Do not publish sensitive exploit details or credentials in a public issue.</p><a class="card-link" href="https://github.com/Yashwanth034/RepoTunnel/security">Security policy</a></article>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
